WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.627 --> 00:00:03.212
We’ve all been curious about

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:05.214
what other people are thinking
or feeling.

00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:08.759
The primary curiosity
has now evolved

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:10.385
into the synchronization

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:12.012
of brainwaves using quantum
entanglement.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.434
So you’re talking about
hacking into brains...

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:19.269
That’s correct.

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.355
The drama Dr. Brain is

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:24.733
a Sci-Fi, detective-mystery
and human drama

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:27.736
in which a scientist who
is innately lacking in sympathy

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:31.114
or empathy, but has excellent
computational ability,

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:36.495
unravels the mysterious events
that take place around him.

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:38.956
Case 37 concluded.

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:42.376
After the death of subject 77,

00:00:40.499 --> 00:00:44.253
a complete transfer to
subject 37 occurred.

00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:46.255
Through the brain scan, which I
developed to solve the

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:48.048
mysterious events around me,

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:55.472
I learn certain memories,
knowledge, and emotions

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:59.142
that I didn’t even know existed.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:02.062
Brainwave sync, a success.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.690
As Sewon gains the ability to
scan people’s brains,

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.693
he uses the ability to unravel

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:11.321
the mysterious events that
happen to his family.

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:13.115
Where’s Doyoon?

00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:14.491
He’s gone.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:15.701
What?

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:16.994
Find him.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:21.581
As he looks into the mind of a
person he barely knows and see s

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:25.085
the memory of his own son, who
he thought was dead,

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.962
a great mystery arises.

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:31.341
Doyoon isn’t dead.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:35.053
Trying to understand what

00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:37.597
happened to his family is his
main driving force.

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.975
It seems clear you’re trying to
avoid suspicion.

00:01:39.975 --> 00:01:43.603
You’re still a suspect in Junki
Lim’s murder.

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.231
He isn’t aware of his abilities
at first,

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:48.358
but he has exceptional memory.

00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:50.402
Not only the memories,

00:01:50.402 --> 00:01:55.449
but physical habits and actions
also get copied to him.

00:01:56.992 --> 00:01:57.868
Wow!

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:01.163
We are telling a story about a

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:03.874
technology that doesn’t
currently exist,

00:02:03.874 --> 00:02:06.501
And I think it ’s exciting that
we were able to tell such a

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:09.504
human story through the idea of
this high-tech,

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:11.465
cutting-edge technology.

00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:15.302
There are many Sci-Fi elements,

00:02:15.302 --> 00:02:20.599
but they are rooted in a human
drama.

00:02:20.599 --> 00:02:23.143
I don’t think there has ever
been a drama

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.895
or movie of a similar genre.

00:02:24.895 --> 00:02:27.147
While the series can be cold, it
is also a red-hot,

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.691
mystery human drama.

